        "https://repo.mongodb.org/apt/debian/dists/bookworm/mongodb-org/8.0/main/binary-amd64/Packages.gz",
        "https://repo.mongodb.org/yum/redhat/9/mongodb-org/8.0/x86_64/repodata/repomd.xml"
      ],
      "verified": "2026-10-28",
      "note": "mongodb-org-server 8.0.34 (deb) and 8.0.9-1.el9 (rpm). endoflife.date lists pkg:deb/*/mongodb, which is not what MongoDB's repository installs, and the rpm name only for redhat, centos and amzn."
